(what I checked) I served the site locally and drove a real Chromium with Playwright at 1600 by 900. Every check passed and the page raised no errors:
- the box opens to 1280 by 720, centred;
- the drawing slides with the pointer;
- the margin, Escape and a click each close it;
- closing over the figure does not reopen it, and a later hover does;
- opening when the pointer starts in the margin band works;
- a quick pass does not open it;
- a 700 px window stays inline;
- a box can be clicked in the enlarged view.
